'''Her Blessing''' is a [[debuff]] that deals 33% of the user's maximum [[life]] and [[energy shield]] to himself as fire [[damage over time]] each second. It lasts 3 seconds, dealing 99% for the whole duration. It is '''not''' an [[ignite]] [[status ailment]] but it can be mitigated with fire [[resistance]].<ref name="HerBlessing" /><ref name="LoveOfASword" />

